<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila stock index down 1.33 pct in late trade.</title>
<headline>Manila stock index down 1.33 pct in late trade.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>------------------------- April 28 --------------------------</p>
<p>		   * Blue chips lead losers</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The Manila stock index fell below its 2,850 support in late trade on Monday due to a sell down on blue chips, traders said.</p>
<p>The main index dropped 1.33 percent to 2,834.14 points after market leaders led by Philippine Long Distance Telephone Co were hit by a new wave of sell offs, said Juanis Barredo, analyst at Citisecurities Inc.</p>
